ra.cpp(689): warning C4334: '<<': result of 32-bit shift implicitly converted to 64 bits (was 64-bit shift intended?)\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/41727042/vs-compilation-warning-result-of-32-bit-shift-implicitly-converted-to-64-bits","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2699004643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2699020995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102360#issuecomment-2699020995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102360","id":2699020995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g38rD","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T21:51:30Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T21:51:54Z","body":"> The CI failure says:\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> Error: modules\\theora\\video_stream_theora.cpp(689): error C2220: the following warning is treated as an error\r\n> Warning