ng for the checks to run again because they had failed to run before. That's why I haven't fixed it until today. This warning isn't caught by my compiler.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2699188912/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733446445","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102360#issuecomment-2733446445","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102360","id":2733446445,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i7RUt","user":{"login":"AndreaMonzini","id":12413409,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDEzNDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12413409?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini","html_url":"https://github.com/AndreaMonzini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T14:23:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T14:30:03Z","body":"Hello,\r\nprobably you already know but just to inform that since few days there is a new release of Theora 1.2.0beta1:\r\n\r\nhttps://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/theora/-/commit/69cf61ef163666f53a48374d3e8df7225913194d\r\n\r\nI do not know if it can be used soon in production but in the release communication i read also:\r\n- A 1.2.0 release is planned in two weeks \r\n\r\nand in the release note in particular i read:\r\n- Converted SCons setup to work with Python 3\r\n- Fixed all known compiler warnings and errors from gcc and clang.\r\n\r\nNews source :\r\nhttps://www.phoronix.com/news/Theora-libtheora-1.2-Beta\r\n\r\nMaybe it can be useful :)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733446445/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733485932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102360#issuecomment-2733485932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102360","id":2733485932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i7a9s","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T14:35:54Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T23:39:20Z","body":"> Hello,\n> probably you already know but just to inform that since few days there is a new release of Theora 1.2.0beta1:\n> \n> https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/theora/-/commit/69cf61ef163666f53a48374d3e8df7225913194d\n> \n> I do not know if it can be used soon in production but in the release communication i read also:\n> - A 1.2.0 release is planned in two weeks \n> \n> and in the release note in particular i read:\n> - Converted SCons setup to work with Python 3\n> - Fixed all known compiler warnings and errors from gcc and clang.\n> \n> Maybe it can be useful :)\n> \n> \n\nThanks. It's great that they're still updating it. We are using a git version that already has those fixes. This new version has been in the works for years. It would probably be a good time to update after the new stable release.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733485932/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733656810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102360#issuecomment-2733656810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102360","id":2733656810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i8Erq","user":{"login":"radlotus","id":95962222,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbhEbg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95962222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radlotus","html_url":"https://github.com/radlotus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radlotus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radlotus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radlotus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radlotus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git